:.ER10  Maior, menor e media de seis notas em L1
:DiagnosticOff
:ClrHome
:.notas 50, 60, 70, 80, 90 e 100
:For(A,0,5)
:(A+5)*10→{A+L₁}
:End
:{L₁}→M
:{L₁}→N
:0→S
:For(A,0,5)
:{A+L₁}→V
:S+V→S
:If V>M
:V→M
:End
:If V<N
:V→N
:End
:End
:"MAIOR:"→Str1
:Disp Str1
:Disp M▶Dec,i
:"MENOR:"→Str2
:Disp Str2
:Disp N▶Dec,i
:"MEDIA:"→Str3
:Disp Str3
:Disp S/6▶Dec
:Pause 1800
